<h2>Is 32Red Legitimate?</h2>
<p><strong>Verified:</strong> 32Red's UK operation is licensed. Checking directly against the <a href="https://www.gamblingcommission.gov.uk/public-register/business/detail/45322">UK Gambling Commission's public register</a> confirms Platinum Gaming Limited holds an active Remote Casino license, account 45322, since 12 July 2016.</p>
